A database from before the ledger (its release 0) meets a build whose
oldest release is 2: refused with what to do, since the lines it may need
were deleted. One from before the ledger is the oldest there is.

== before
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, title TEXT NOT NULL) STRICT;
INSERT INTO dish VALUES (1, 'soup');

== after
-- @release 3
-- @oldest 2
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL) STRICT;

== error
the database is at release 0, before `-- @oldest 2`: the @drop and @from lines it needs were deleted. Open it first with an executable of a release that still had them, or put them back.
